# Authors and Contributors

This project contains patches and fixes for the MediaTek MT7925/MT7921 WiFi
driver based on the upstream mt76 driver.

## Original mt76 Driver

Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
  - Original mt76 driver author and maintainer

MediaTek Inc.
  - MT7921/MT7925 chipset support

Sean Wang <sean.wang@mediatek.com>
  - Upstream MT7925 driver development
  - ROC deadlock fix (patch 01)

## MT7925 Fixes and Patches

Zac Bowling <zac@zacbowling.com>
  - Project maintainer
  - MLO NULL pointer fixes
  - Mutex protection patches
  - MCU error handling
  - DKMS packaging

## Contributors

David Hubbard <davidhubbard@users.noreply.github.com>
  - Testing and feedback
